cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Zero-TVM: Phi-3-mini in the browser on hand-written WGSL kernels"
abstract: >-
  A browser-native Phi-3-mini inference engine built on 10 hand-written WGSL
  kernel roles (37 files) and ~2,000 lines of TypeScript, replacing WebLLM /
  MLC-LLM's TVM-compiled 85-kernel stack while measuring 16% higher total
  throughput and 31% higher decode throughput on identical quantized weights
  (Apple M2 Max, 2026-07-30 same-session head-to-head).
type: software
